	"system": {
		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p><strong>Usage</strong> drawn on a shield</p><hr><p>This rune resembles a broken arrow. The shield bearing the rune gains a +2 status bonus to its Hardness against physical damage from ranged attacks.</p><p><strong>Invocation</strong> (illusion, mental, visual) The rune creates an illusion in the minds of all creatures adjacent to the rune-bearer that lasts for 1 round. The illusion is of a large, impassable wall blocking all paths away from the rune-bearer. Creatures affected by this invocation can't willingly move farther away from the rune-bearer for 1 round or until they disbelieve the illusion, usually by using a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action.</p><hr><p><strong>Level (+4)</strong> The status bonus to Hardness increases by 1.</p>"
		},
